<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Koozie Group PO# {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c} Notice of Cancellation. Order# {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_Number__c}, {!relatedTo.ThreadID_FK__c}" 
recipientType="Contact"  relatedToType="case">

    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >

<html>

<style>
body {font-family: 'source sans pro';}
</style>

<span style="font-size:8px;"><img src="https://kooziegroup--c.documentforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153p000003Puwa&oid=00D1U000000oeAl&lastMod=1605490999000" style="max-width: 840.197px; width: 140.998px; height: 25.9981px;" title="Koozie Group Logo" /></span><br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-size:15px;"><b><span style="color:#009faa;"><span style="text-decoration: none; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black;, sans-serif;&quot;;">keep</span></span><span style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="color:#da9122;">the</span>&nbsp;<b><span style="color:#94bd4c;"><span style="text-decoration: none; font-family: Source Sans Pro;, sans-serif;&quot;;">good</span></span><span style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black;, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="color:#92278a;">going<span style="text-decoration: none; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black&quot;, sans-serif;">&reg;</span></span></span><br />
<br />


<p>Thanks for ordering from Koozie Group! Unfortunately, your order remains on hold.</p>

 <p><b>We are still waiting on clarification regarding issues with your order and have not received a response. We hope to get this resolved soon, but if we don’t hear back from you within the next 24 hours, we will have to cancel this order.</b></p>
    
  <li>Customer Name: {!relatedTo.Customer_Name__c}</li>
    <li>Customer Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Account_Number__c}</li>
    <li>PO Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}</li>
    <li>Order Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}</li>
    <apex:variable var="idx" value="{!0}"/>

    <apex:repeat var="cx1" value="{!relatedTo.Clarification_Questions__r}">
     <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!if(idx==0,true,false)}">
<apex:outputpanel rendered="{!if(relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '35519' || relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '35509' || relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '13967' || relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '13428' || relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '33381' || relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '35511' || relatedTo.Account.Parent_EBS__c == '35513'
                                    || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c == '35519' || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c == '35509' || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c== '13967' || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c == '13428' || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c == '33381' || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c == '35511' || relatedTo.Account.Customer_Account_Number__c == '35513',true,false)}">
    
    <p>All you need to do now is <b>click the link below</b> to respond to any clarifications needed to be able to proceed with your order.</p>  
   <li>Link: <a href="{!relatedTo.Clar_Link__c}"> {!relatedTo.Clar_Link__c}</a> </li>
    </apex:outputpanel>
    </apex:outputpanel>
        <apex:variable var="idx" value="{!idx + 1}" />
    </apex:repeat>
    <br/>
<!--    
<p>All you need to do now is <b>click the link below</b> to respond to any clarifications needed to be able to proceed with your order.</p>  
 Go To the Link : <a href="{!relatedTo.EBS_Order__r.Tracking_Link_NoPricing__c}">{!relatedTo.EBS_Order__r.Tracking_Link_No_Pricing__c}</a>
-->

<p>Please be advised that your order is <b><u>ON HOLD</u></b> until you have provided responses to each clarification.</p> 

    <li><b>PO Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}</b></li>
    <li><b>Order Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}</b></li>

<!--  
<p><b>You must follow the link below to view what is needed to proceed with your order.</b>Please do not reply to this email. Replying to this email will not move your order into production as timely.</p>
-->
    
<p>
<apex:repeat var="cx" value="{!relatedTo.Clarification_Questions__r}">

<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!if((cx.Status__c != 'Closed' && cx.Status__c != 'Answered' && cx.Status__c != 'Canceled') && cx.recordtype.name=='ClarificationQuestion' ,true,false)}">

<tr >
 <td>Product Number: &nbsp;{!cx.Product_Number__c}</td><br/>
 <td>Line Number: &nbsp;{!cx.Line_Number__c}</td><br/>
 <td>Message Text: &nbsp;{!cx.Message_Text__c}</td><br/>
 <br/>
</tr>
</apex:outputPanel>
</apex:repeat>
</p> 

<!--
  <p><b>If clicking this link results in an error, please copy and paste the address into your internet browser.</b></p>  
-->


<p>All the best, <br/>
The Koozie Group Customer Care Krew<br/></p>



<a href="https://www.kooziegroup.com/US/" style="text-decoration:none;color:#456FB2;font-size:18px;font-family:Source Sans Pro Black,sans-serif;">kooziegroup.com</a><br />
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="color:black"><span style="line-height:.8;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif">You can check order status and inventory, estimate shipping, create a virtual sample or access case studies, test reports, images and templates. It&rsquo;s all there!</span></span></span>


<p style="font-family:Source Sans Pro ;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#456fb2;"><b><span style="font-size:18px;">send orders to:</span></b></span><br />
<span style="color:#ffc107"><span style="font-size:11px"><span style="color:#ffc107"><span style="font-size:11px"><span style="color:black"><b>24 Hour Orders:</b>&nbsp;<b style="color: rgb(69, 111, 178);"><a href="mailto: 24hour@kooziegroup.com" style="color:#456FB2">24hour@kooziegroup.com</a></b><br />
<b>Standard&nbsp;Production Orders:</b>&nbsp;<a href="mailto: orders@kooziegroup.com" style="color:#456FB2"><b>orders@kooziegroup.com</b></a><br />
<b>Random Samples and Marketing Collateral Orders:</b>&nbsp;<a href="mailto: samples@kooziegroup.com" style="color:#456FB2"><b>samples@kooziegroup.com</b></a> <span style="color:#ffc107"> <span style="font-size:11px"> <span style="color:#ffc107"><span style="font-size:11px"><span style="color:black"> </span></span></span> </span> </span> </span></span></span></span></span></p>
    
